      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصِلٌ</span></b> , (K,) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصِيلٌ</span></b> , (M,) i. q. ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْتَأْصِلٌ</span></b> .
(M, K.) You say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَلْعٌ أَصِلٌ</span> <i>Eradicating,</i> or <i>extirpating, evulsion:</i> (TA:) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَطْعٌ أَصِيلٌ</span></b>  <i>extirpating excision.</i> (M.)

